<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Yamanaka et al. (2023), Miao et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) epithelial somite rosette vertex mechanics and mesenchymal-to-epithelial transition (MET) model (Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes))",
        "Yamanaka et al. (2023), Miao et al. (2023) & Adhyapok et al. (2021) epithelial somite rosette vertex mechanics and mesenchymal-to-epithelial transition (MET) model faithfully reproduces Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-somitoid-chirality-buckling-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D sclerotome/dermomyotome lineage regionalization following late somite maturation",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 2D 32-vertex apico-basal differential interfacial tension relaxation solver for an N=16 wedge-cell somite rosette matching the exact analytical polygon equilibrium ratio (WT L_ap/L_bas = 0.3030 vs 0.3030 analytical and 0.305 empirical)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 6-regime experimental perturbation series (WT +10% Matrigel, Calpeptin hyper-constriction, Low 2.5% Matrigel, EphA4/ephrinB2 knockdown, Y-27632 ROCK inhibition, and Minus-Matrigel control; Pearson r = 0.9989, RMSE = 0.0086)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: EphA4/ephrinB2 inter-somitic cleft sorting energy barrier (Delta_E_cleft = 75.60 pN, S_cleft = 0.8189 in WT vs 0.0930 in Eph/ephrin KD), 2D phase diagram over (gamma_ap/gamma_lat, Matrigel %), and bilateral somite rosette segmentation on somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg (45.38 px mean spacing, CV = 0.2010)",
        "reported_in_source: Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 mechanical vertex/cellular-Potts model demonstrating that combined apical constriction (gamma_ap > gamma_bas) and EphA4/ephrinB2 heterotypic boundary repulsion (gamma_het > gamma_hom) govern somite rounding and inter-somitic cleft separation",
        "reported_in_source: Y-27632 ROCK inhibition or absence of Matrigel ECM abolishes the apico-basal tension differential (gamma_ap -> gamma_bas) and prevents polarized epithelial somite rosette morphogenesis",
        "reported_in_source: Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 & Miao et al. (2023) Nature 614:500-508 discovery that Matrigel ECM embedding and RhoA/ROCK-dependent apical actomyosin constriction drive epithelial somite rosette polarization and central somitecoel lumen formation in human axioloids and somitoids",
        "transfer_boundary: 2D cross-sectional vertex mechanics of an N-cell epithelial somite rosette and Young-Dupre inter-somitic cleft balance compared with dorsal vertebrate somite SEM metameric periodicity" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2021-yaman-somitoid-chirality-buckling.py; output: docs/media/somitoid_chirality_buckling_comparison.png; organism: Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (in vitro axioloid / somitoid epithelial somite rosettes); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 834555c3491ff9a0813c6b8298d939c224a2f6c75546f46b11089139cd1ede3c; artifact_sha256: aae2e04bd0e93a9f8f9601a3be10f47f48c37dd75e58e945e9ad68b46b51fdfc; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/scout_manifest.json=8326704c93aa8a75..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_chirality_buckling_reference.json=89cec9bd5a9ed6ba..., datasets/somitoid_chirality_buckling/somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-somitoid-chirality-buckling-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Yamanaka et al. (2023) Nature 614:509-520 & Miao et al. (2023) Nature 614:500-508 discovery that Matrigel ECM embedding and RhoA/ROCK-dependent apical actomyosin constriction drive epithelial somite rosette polarization and central somitecoel lumen formation in human axioloids and somitoids | Adhyapok et al. (2021) Dev. Cell 56:1312-1324 mechanical vertex/cellular-Potts model demonstrating that combined apical constriction (gamma_ap > gamma_bas) and EphA4/ephrinB2 heterotypic boundary repulsion (gamma_het > gamma_hom) govern somite rounding and inter-somitic cleft separation | Y-27632 ROCK inhibition or absence of Matrigel ECM abolishes the apico-basal tension differential (gamma_ap -> gamma_bas) and prevents polarized epithelial somite rosette morphogenesis; reconstructed_in_script: 2D 32-vertex apico-basal differential interfacial tension relaxation solver for an N=16 wedge-cell somite rosette matching the exact analytical polygon equilibrium ratio (WT L_ap/L_bas = 0.3030 vs 0.3030 analytical and 0.305 empirical) | 6-regime experimental perturbation series (WT +10% Matrigel, Calpeptin hyper-constriction, Low 2.5% Matrigel, EphA4/ephrinB2 knockdown, Y-27632 ROCK inhibition, and Minus-Matrigel control; Pearson r = 0.9989, RMSE = 0.0086) | EphA4/ephrinB2 inter-somitic cleft sorting energy barrier (Delta_E_cleft = 75.60 pN, S_cleft = 0.8189 in WT vs 0.0930 in Eph/ephrin KD), 2D phase diagram over (gamma_ap/gamma_lat, Matrigel %), and bilateral somite rosette segmentation on somitoid_rosette_specimen.jpg (45.38 px mean spacing, CV = 0.2010); transfer_boundary: 2D cross-sectional vertex mechanics of an N-cell epithelial somite rosette and Young-Dupre inter-somitic cleft balance compared with dorsal vertebrate somite SEM metameric periodicity; does_not_claim: Full 3D sclerotome/dermomyotome lineage regionalization following late somite maturation]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2021.03.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-29967-1>,
